A smart classic piano simulator with a chord-picking function will impress you with its astounding sound! Making music is now easier: Piano Keyboard will help you learn sheet music, famous classical pieces and improvise on the keyboard.

AI Synthesizer supports several modes:
CREATING MUSIC - artificial intelligence will pick up chords for you in a given harmony, which will help you create a musical masterpiece!

FREE MODE - convenient for improving your piano skills;
TRAINING - for studying famous pieces of music;
CHORD LEARNING - useful and easy lessons for learning the piano basics.

Features of AI Piano app:
* Smart selection of chords in the chosen harmony;
* A large collection of works by great authors;
* Special training mode for beginners;
* Popular ringtones in training mode;
* Record and save function (use the MIC button);
* Great sound of a real piano;
* Clear interface with quick access to all functions from one screen.

Enjoy the sound of a real piano with Piano Keyboard - Learn To Play. Contribute to the development of classical music! Learn, create, play music!

